{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55409","headline":"题远大师塔 · 相里宗","name":"题远大师塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元墓石棱棱，寒云晚景凝。\n空悲虎溪月，不见应门僧。\n（《太平寰宇记》卷一一一《江州》。\n）（按：《庐山记》卷四、《万首唐人绝句》卷九五、《全唐诗》卷八一○收此诗爲僧灵澈作。\n按《全唐诗》卷七五○李中有《送相里秀才之匡山国子监》诗，相里秀才即相里宗，身份、地点皆合，可知其爲南唐人。\n《太平寰宇记》称此诗爲「南进士相里宗题诗」，此书作者乐史爲南唐入宋之人，又爲江西人，其说当可信。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"相里宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}